        {
          "text": "Aanani ooka, ũmwe wa ana‐a‐asa makwa, we na andũ amwe ala maumĩte Yuta; na namakũlya ũvoo wa Ayuti ala mavonokie ala matialile ma ala matavĩtwe, na ũvoo wa Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
