        {
          "text": "yu kũtũ kwaku nĩkwĩthukĩĩsye, na metho maku methĩwe masalukĩtye, nĩ kana wĩthukĩĩsye kũvoya kwa mũthũkũmi waku, kũla ngũvoya nĩ mbee waku ĩvinda yĩĩ, mũthenya na ũtukũ, ũndũ wa ana ma Isilaeli athũkũmi maku, yĩla ngumbũla naĩ sya ana ma Isilaeli, ila twakũvĩtanĩĩsye. Ĩĩ, nyie na nyũmba ya asa wakwa nĩtũvĩtĩtye: ",
