              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ame Mwĩaĩi, nĩngũkwĩsũva, kũtũ kwaku yu nĩkwĩthukĩĩsye kũvoya kwa mũthũkũmi waku, na kũvoya kwa athũkũmi maku, ala matanĩaa kũkĩa syĩtwa yaku; na nĩngũkwĩsũva, ũmũathime mũthũkũmi waku ũmũnthĩ, na ũimwĩw’ĩa tei methonĩ ma mũndũ ũũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
